{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1791-modelling-handball-outcomes-using-univariate-and.md", "equation": "Bivariate copula PMF: P(Y1=y1,Y2=y2) = C(F(y1),G(y2)) − C(F(y1−1),G(y2)) − C(F(y1),G(y2−1)) + C(F(y1−1),G(y2−1)).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9137}
